<v Ira Glass>That link is also in the show notes. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. This week, the place that he goes for acupuncture, they offered him a job. He told them, that's ridiculous.

00:57:49.420 --> 00:57:54.700
<v Alani Bankhead>Why would I go work for the same organization that has stabbed me in the back?

